  "implemented": [
    "Core assembles the frozen configured 1\u201316-key sequence from attributed callbacks. A bounded suffix/prefix matcher accepts repeated real keys and composite observations without trusting a caller-supplied expected sequence. Malformed batches discard the prefix.",
    "Opaque capture ordinals are never wire claims. Fresh authority is required before consuming an observation. Replaying an observed event cannot supply another key; gaps and out-of-order observations cannot join a prefix across lost callbacks. Pre-answer and pre-media captures retain their specific refusal after later readiness.",
    "Partial and completed confirmation retain actual controller revision, credential and duplex port/consumer/subscription incarnation. Stale queued events are refused; a media change requires a complete fresh confirmation. The physical plan checks the confirmed stamp at the final target fence with target state already locked.",
    "Credential capture checks current credential, expiry and atomic shutdown without waiting for controller mutation state. All closed transitions cancel shutdown first. Readiness capture uses nonblocking scene/state fences to avoid reverse connection/media lock ordering. Transient mutation-state contention does not consume a retryable opaque observation.",
    "Actual SIP fixture enters 55# as three INFO keypresses, refuses retransmitted INFO as another callback, refuses opaque replay, rejects a wrong key and commits one generation-two move. Strict decoded duplex remains after original-device shutdown. Output-only confirmation and preparation-main-leakage negatives remain unchanged.",
    "Native cases cover replay, out-of-order and lost callbacks, queued digits across pause/resume, completed confirmation invalidation and stale-plan refusal. A fresh full sequence succeeds afterward. All sixteen allowed keys and malformed batch rejection are tested through current native authority and actual media.",
    "Fresh public native regression retains six known managed moves, generation three, Observer behavior, original-source/controller loss, current target loss, retained stream controls and blocked projection recovery without replay. All 122 strict decoded PCMU audience probes retain their thresholds."
  ],
